    family-names: Khan
    affiliation: Nanyang Technological University
repository-code: "https://github.com/SupremeMaxitout/Humanization-of-Human-Adenovirus"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible computational pipeline for immune-evasive adenovirus capsid
  engineering: homology-guided humanisation of hexon hypervariable regions,
  structure prediction, model validation, immune-component docking, and
  molecular dynamics stability screening.
